SUMMARY:Podcasting 101
DESCRIPTION:Interested in creating your own podcast? Want to learn how to p
 roduce one using free software? Then podcasting 101 is perfect for you! Du
 ring the workshop you will: Get expert advice on how to get a great record
 ing (including using the resources available at State Library). Learn the 
 basics of how to record and edit audio in Audacity. Pick up tips and trick
 s when it comes to hosting\, distributing and building an audience for you
 r content. Our 101 workshops are a great way to gain some new skills and e
 xplore creative tools learning from experienced local creatives in an incl
 usive space.Please consult our conditions of entry and Ticketing Terms and
  Conditions.Participants under 16 years of age must be accompanied by a gu
 ardian.Please contact us if you need support to participate in this event.
